WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.401 line:92%
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:02.335 line:92%
and this is "Late Night."

00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:03.269 line:92%
And we really do hope that

00:00:03.269 --> 00:00:04.537 line:92%
you're all doing well tonight,

00:00:04.537 --> 00:00:05.372 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
collectively.

00:00:05.372 --> 00:00:07.173 size:84% position:42% line:92%
And, if even one of you

00:00:07.173 --> 00:00:08.375 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
isn't doing well,

00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:10.677 line:92%
well, the evening's ruined

00:00:10.677 --> 00:00:12.612 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
Let's get to the news.

00:00:12.612 --> 00:00:13.380 line:92%
The Senate voted yesterday

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:15.815 align:start size:94% position:6%
to block the For the Peopl
voting rights bill,

00:00:15.815 --> 00:00:18.885
but not until they got their
voting paperwork in order.

00:00:18.885 --> 00:00:21.121 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Let's see.
I got my license, passport

00:00:21.121 --> 00:00:22.522 align:start size:94% position:6%
tax returns,
high school yearbook.

00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:25.392 align:start size:94% position:6%
Okay. I think I'm ready
for my riddle."

00:00:25.392 --> 00:00:27.627 align:start size:94% position:6%
All 50 Senate Republicans
voted yesterday

00:00:27.627 --> 00:00:30.797 align:start size:94% position:6%
to block the For the Peopl
voting rights bill,

00:00:30.797 --> 00:00:34.134 align:start size:94% position:6%
but they did have
a counteroffer.

00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:36.803 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
Republican Senator Mike Le

00:00:36.803 --> 00:00:40.473
said, in an interview yesterda
with Fox News host Sean Hannity,

00:00:40.473 --> 00:00:43.043 size:84% position:42%
that the For the People
voting rights act was

00:00:43.043 --> 00:00:46.046 align:start size:94% position:6%
"written in hell
by the devil himself,"

00:00:46.046 --> 00:00:50.216 align:start size:94% position:6%
which is also what it says
on the poster for "F9."

00:00:50.216 --> 00:00:50.750 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:53.920
The White House said yesterday
that it will likely fall short

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:58.158 align:start size:94% position:6%
of its goal of vaccinating 70%
of U.S. adults by July 4th

00:00:58.158 --> 00:01:01.861 align:start size:94% position:6%
but at least the announcemen
will be spectacular.

00:01:01.861 --> 00:01:02.629 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:02.629 --> 00:01:03.997 line:92%
Dr. Anthony Fauci said yesterday

00:01:03.997 --> 00:01:06.533 size:81% position:41%
that the Delta variant
of the coronavirus is

00:01:06.533 --> 00:01:09.302 align:start size:94% position:6%
"unquestionably
more transmissible

00:01:09.302 --> 00:01:11.838 align:start size:94% position:6%
than other common variants
of COVID-19."

00:01:11.838 --> 00:01:13.773 align:start size:94% position:6%
Alright, I feel like,
as a treat,

00:01:13.773 --> 00:01:17.010 align:start size:94% position:6%
we should let Fauci
announce some good news.

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:19.412 align:start size:94% position:6%
Doesn't even have to be
science-based.

00:01:19.412 --> 00:01:21.648 size:78% position:39% line:92%
A second season of...

00:01:21.648 --> 00:01:23.316 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ As Fauci ]
Mare's back, everybody.

00:01:23.316 --> 00:01:23.883 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
We're so excited.

00:01:23.883 --> 00:01:26.319 size:88% position:44%
Just something, so that,
when he shows up on TV,

00:01:26.319 --> 00:01:28.521 align:start size:94% position:6%
we aren't immediately like
"Now what?

00:01:28.521 --> 00:01:30.623 line:92%
Did the COVID bat have babies?

00:01:30.623 --> 00:01:31.791 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
That's right,

00:01:31.791 --> 00:01:33.393 line:92%
Dr. Anthony Fauci said yesterday

00:01:33.393 --> 00:01:35.662 size:81% position:41%
that the Delta variant
of the coronavirus is

00:01:35.662 --> 00:01:37.797 align:start size:94% position:6%
"unquestionably
more transmissible

00:01:37.797 --> 00:01:40.166 align:start size:94% position:6%
than other common variants
of COVID-19."

00:01:40.166 --> 00:01:42.235 align:start size:94% position:6%
Unfortunately,
it was tough to hear him

00:01:42.235 --> 00:01:44.437 align:start size:94% position:6%
over the Foo Fighters.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:44.437 --> 00:01:47.173
New York held its Democratic
mayoral primary yesterday,

00:01:47.173 --> 00:01:50.610 align:start size:94% position:6%
but, due to the city's use
of rank choice voting,

00:01:50.610 --> 00:01:51.377 size:88% position:44% line:92%
it will be several weeks

00:01:51.377 --> 00:01:53.780 align:start size:94% position:6%
before a winner is
formally declared.

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:55.148 size:81% position:41% line:92%
Said Eric Adams, "Ugh!

00:01:55.148 --> 00:01:59.185 align:start size:94% position:6%
I got to hang around the cit
for several weeks?!"

00:01:59.185 --> 00:02:01.955 align:start size:94% position:6%
A trade group representing
U.S. airlines this week

00:02:01.955 --> 00:02:05.358
called on the Justice Department
to impose stricter punishments

00:02:05.358 --> 00:02:07.994 size:78% position:39%
on unruly passengers,
up to and including

00:02:07.994 --> 00:02:09.963 align:start size:94% position:6%
middle seats.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.963 --> 00:02:11.965 align:start size:94% position:6%
In honor of actress
Meryl Streep's

00:02:11.965 --> 00:02:12.799 size:88% position:44% line:92%
72nd birthday yesterday,

00:02:12.799 --> 00:02:17.637
fans changed New York City's
72nd Street Subway Station

00:02:17.637 --> 00:02:19.339 size:78% position:39% line:92%
to say "72nd Streep,"

00:02:19.339 --> 00:02:21.274 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then Streep won
another Oscar

00:02:21.274 --> 00:02:23.543 line:92%
for her reaction to that news.

00:02:23.543 --> 00:02:25.044 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"Oh, my God!

00:02:25.044 --> 00:02:27.213 size:84% position:42% line:92%
This is such an honor."

00:02:27.213 --> 00:02:28.148 size:88% position:44% line:92%
In honor of Cinema Week,

00:02:28.148 --> 00:02:30.083 align:start size:94% position:6%
AMC Theaters
is offering customers

00:02:30.083 --> 00:02:31.718 line:92%
an all-you-can-eat popcorn dea

00:02:31.718 --> 00:02:35.421 align:start size:94% position:6%
and an all-you-can-stand
nacho deal.

00:02:35.421 --> 00:02:38.224
The amusement park at New York's
Coney Island next month

00:02:38.224 --> 00:02:39.659 align:start size:94% position:6%
will unveil its new,
custom-made,

00:02:39.659 --> 00:02:41.694 align:start size:94% position:6%
68-foot tall roller coaster,
the Phoenix,

00:02:41.694 --> 00:02:44.998
though, if you really want
a thrill at Coney Island,

00:02:44.998 --> 00:02:46.266 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
get in the water.

00:02:46.266 --> 00:02:46.900 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:46.900 --> 00:02:49.068
In a letter to the court,
a woman who was charged

00:02:49.068 --> 00:02:52.172 align:start size:94% position:6%
with participating in the
January attack on the Capito

00:02:52.172 --> 00:02:54.974 align:start size:94% position:6%
told the judge that she learne
the error of her ways

00:02:54.974 --> 00:02:56.910 size:78% position:39%
by watching the movie
"Schindler's List,"

00:02:56.910 --> 00:03:00.180 align:start size:94% position:6%
which, she said,
"was hard to watch."

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:01.814 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"Okay, rude!"

00:03:01.814 --> 00:03:03.383 size:81% position:41% line:92%
said Steven Spielberg.

00:03:03.383 --> 00:03:03.950 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:06.753 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, finally, today was
National Pink Day,

00:03:06.753 --> 00:03:09.989 align:start size:94% position:6%
thanks to yet another
gender reveal gone wrong.

00:03:09.989 --> 00:03:12.926 align:start size:94% position:6%
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

